,"en":"ESMO Living Guideline: Lymphomas"},"version":"v1.1","updated":"2026-02-01"},{"kind":"other","url":"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC13680546/","label":{"uk":"EHA Clinical Practice Guidelines: фолікулярна лімфома (HemaSphere 2026)","en":"EHA Clinical Practice Guidelines: follicular lymphoma (HemaSphere 2026)"},"version":"2026","updated":"2026-10-19"}]}]$catalog$::jsonb)
